<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt"><B>Proposal No. 6&#151;The Nasdaq Proposal</B>&#151;to consider and vote upon a proposal by ordinary resolution
to approve, for the purposes of complying with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(a), (b) and (d), the issuance of ATI Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares and the ATI Class&nbsp;V ordinary share in connection with the Business Combination and the PIPE Financing. We
refer to this proposal as the &#147;<U>Nasdaq Proposal</U>.&#148; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
