<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt"><B>Proposal No. 7&#151;Equity Incentive Plan Proposal</B>&#151; to consider and vote upon the approval by
ordinary resolution of the ATI 2023 Equity Incentive Plan, a copy of which is attached to the accompanying proxy statement as <U>Annex G</U>. We refer to this proposal as the &#147;<U>Equity Incentive Plan Proposal</U>.&#148; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
