connection with the Business Combination, and assumes 52,600, 701,683 and 2,725,664 Bonus Shares are issued to the Aeries Employees under no redemptions, medium redemptions and maximum redemptions, respectively. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
