each of the following three months. For further details on the Second Extension Amendment and the relevant non-redemption agreements, see &#147;<I>WWAC&#146;s Management&#146;s Discussion and
Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations</I>&#151;<I>Recent Developments</I>.&#148; </TD></TR></TABLE>
