<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:5.5pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Assumes an aggregate of 34,554,454 ATI Class A ordinary shares are issued to the Sole Shareholder and the
Aeries Holders pursuant to the Exchange Agreements. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:5.5pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
