<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">WWAC&#146;s shareholders also are being asked to consider and vote upon a proposal to replace the Existing
Memorandum and Articles of Association, in each case, under Cayman Islands law with the Proposed Memorandum and Articles of Association, which differ from the Existing Memorandum and Articles of Association in the following material respects:
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
