<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">The authorized capital stock under the Existing Memorandum and Articles of Association is 500,000,000 Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares of par value $0.0001 per share, 50,000,000 Class&nbsp;B ordinary shares of par value $0.0001 per
share and 5,000,000 preference shares of par value $0.0001 per share.</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">The Proposed Memorandum and Articles of Association authorize (i) 500,000,000 Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares, par value $0.0001 per share, (ii) 1 Class&nbsp;V ordinary share, par value $0.0001 per share, and (iii) 5,000,000 preference
shares, par value $0.0001 per share.</TD></TR>
