Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares, assuming that no party initiating an exchange elects to settle such exchange with a Cash Exchange Payment, pursuant to the Exchange Agreements from and after April 1, 2024. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
