<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">
and (2) in certain circumstances, including the threat of a hostile change of control of WWAC, 51% of the total issued and outstanding ATI Class A ordinary shares and ATI Class V ordinary share
voting together as a class. Upon the exchange of all AARK ordinary shares held by the Sole Shareholder pursuant to the AARK Exchange Agreement, the ATI Class&nbsp;V ordinary share will be automatically forfeited and cancelled. </TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
