<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">The Aeries projected financial information included in this proxy statement/prospectus is forward looking and
reflects numerous estimates, beliefs and assumptions, all of which are difficult to predict and many of which are beyond WWAC&#146;s and Aeries&#146; control. If these assumptions prove to be incorrect, the Combined Company&#146;s actual operating
results may be materially different from the forecasted results. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
