uncertain and difficult to predict and many of which are beyond Aeries&#146; control. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Projections were developed by Aeries and
considered various material assumptions at the time they were initially prepared and provided to WWAC, including, but not limited to, the following: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
