private placement warrants to purchase Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares and such private placement warrants will expire worthless if an initial business combination is not consummated by November 22, 2023 (unless such date is extended in accordance with
the Existing Memorandum and Articles of Association). A portion of the proceeds from such private placement were placed in the trust account. Such warrants had an estimated aggregate value of $801,000 based on the closing price of $0.09 per public
warrant on Nasdaq as of the close of business on October 16, 2023, the most recent practicable date prior to the date of this proxy statement/prospectus; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
