directors&#146; and officers&#146; liability insurance after the Business Combination (i.e., a &#147;tail policy&#148;); </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
