target businesses and performing due diligence on suitable business combinations unless an initial business combination is consummated by November 22, 2023 (unless such date is extended in accordance with the Existing Memorandum and Articles of
Association), although no such amounts require reimbursement as of the date of this proxy statement/prospectus; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
