Amalgamation Sub will be converted into an amount of AARK ordinary shares based upon a conversion ratio defined in the Business Combination Agreement, </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
