<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">(A) Sponsor will forfeit 1,500,000 Class&nbsp;B ordinary shares at the Effective Time and (B)(x) if WWAC
Available Cash at Closing is less than $50&nbsp;million, forfeit an additional 1,500,000 Class&nbsp;B ordinary shares or (y)&nbsp;if WWAC Available Cash at Closing is $50&nbsp;million or more, subject 1,500,000 ATI Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares to an
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">earn-out</FONT> based on the trading price of the ATI Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares over the five-year period post-Closing, </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
