<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">the Exchanging Aeries Holders will enter into an exchange agreement with Aeries and WWAC in the form attached
to the proxy statement/prospectus as <U>Annex C</U> (the &#147;<U>Aeries Exchange Agreement</U>&#148;), and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
