common stock (&#147;the Holders&#148;) in accordance with the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Non-Redemption</FONT> Agreement entered into between WWAC, the Sponsor, and the Holders of Class&nbsp;A common stock. In connection with the <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Non-Redemption</FONT> Agreement, the Sponsor will forfeit 987,000 shares of the Company&#146;s Class&nbsp;B ordinary shares and 987,000 Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares of Aeries Technology, Inc. shall be issued to the
Holders. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
