common stock issued to Anchor Investors upon conversion of the existing WWAC Class&nbsp;B ordinary shares concurrently with the consummation of the Business Combination. In both a No, Medium, and Maximum Redemptions scenario, 2,013,000 Class&nbsp;B
ordinary shares will be forfeited by the Sponsor upon the consummation of the Business Combination. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
