<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Includes 52,600 Bonus Shares, from the 3,750,000 Bonus Share Pool, to be issued to certain AARK employees at
the consummation of the Business Combination. Does not include 10,000 AARK ordinary shares and 655,788 Aeries ordinary shares that represent noncontrolling interest in AARK. These shares will be exchangeable (together with the proportionate
reduction in the voting power of the Class&nbsp;V Share, and in the case of the exchange of all AARK Ordinary Shares, the forfeiture and cancellation of the Class&nbsp;V Share) into shares in Aeries Technology, Inc. in connection with the Exchange
Agreements, as noted above. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
