<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">meeting to review and discuss our annual audited financial statements and quarterly financial statements with
management and the independent auditor, including reviewing our specific disclosures under &#147;<I>WWAC&#146;s Management&#146;s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations</I>&#148;; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
