company until the last day of the fiscal year in which (i)&nbsp;the market value of WWAC&#146;s Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares held by <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-affiliates</FONT> exceeds
$250&nbsp;million as of the prior June&nbsp;30, or (ii)&nbsp;WWAC&#146;s annual revenues exceeds $100&nbsp;million during such completed fiscal year and the market value of WWAC&#146;s Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares held by <FONT
