SharePoint and Power Platform focused on organizational efficiencies and processes to provide accurate insights, and automations for <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">business-as-usual</FONT></FONT> tasks.
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Innovation Labs </I></B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Aeries&#146; Innovation Labs incubates, develops, and propagates new ideas and creates intellectual property, by exploring collaborations with
partners and stakeholders to facilitate and accelerate business opportunities. Below are some of the focus areas of Aeries Innovation Labs. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
