<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Prior to the Business Combination, the percentage of beneficial ownership of WWAC on October 16, 2023, the most
recent practicable date prior to the date of this proxy statement/prospectus, is calculated based on (i) 3,799,067 Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares and (ii) 5,750,000 Class&nbsp;B ordinary shares, in each case, outstanding as of such date.
</P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:9pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
