<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(8)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">According to a Schedule 13G filed on May 18, 2023, Class A ordinary shares reported herein are held by Exos
Collateralized SPAC Holdings Fund LP (the &#147;Exos Fund&#148;). Exos Asset Management LLC (&#147;Exos&#148;) serves as the investment manager to the Exos Fund. By virtue of this relationship, the reporting persons may be deemed to have shared
voting and dispositive power with respect to the Class A ordinary shares owned directly by the Exos Fund. Each of the reporting persons disclaims beneficial ownership of the Class A ordinary shares reported except to the extent of the reporting
person&#146;s pecuniary interest therein. The address of Exos and the Collateralized SPAC Fund is 1370 Broadway, Suite 1450, New York, NY 10018. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:9pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
