<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">at a price of $0.10 per Warrant, provided that holders will be able to exercise their Warrants on a cashless
basis prior to redemption and receive that number of Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares determined in part by the redemption date and the &#147;fair market value&#148; of the Class&nbsp;A ordinary shares except as otherwise below; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
