$1,374 within &#147;Selling, general&nbsp;&amp; administrative expenses&#148; in the condensed <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">carve-out</FONT> consolidated statements of operations. During the three months ended June&nbsp;30, 2022, the Company did
not record any stock-based compensation expense as the stock options issued were fully vested. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">There were no amounts capitalized as part
of <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">internal-use</FONT> software under development for the three months ended&nbsp;June 30, 2023 and 2022. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">As of June&nbsp;30, 2023, the total remaining unrecognized stock-based compensation cost was $332. As of June&nbsp;30, 2022, there was no
unrecognized stock-based compensation cost. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
