<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Corporate Guarantees </I></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The
Company has an outstanding guarantee of nil and INR 200,000 (or approximately $2,438 at the exchange rate in effect on June&nbsp;30, 2023, and approximately $2,433 at the exchange rate in effect on March&nbsp;31, 2023) as of June&nbsp;30, 2023 and
March&nbsp;31, 2023, respectively, which pertains to a fund-based and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-fund</FONT> based revolving credit facility availed by an affiliate, Bhanix Finance and Investment Ltd, from Kotak Mahindra Bank. The
</P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-63 </P>

