</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Aeries Management Stock Option Plan, 2019 </I></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On September&nbsp;23, 2019, the Board of Directors approved and executed the Aeries Management Stock Option Plan 2019 (&#147;MSOP&#148;), which
was subsequently amended on September&nbsp;30, 2022. Under the plan, the Company has authorized to grant not exceeding 295,565 options to eligible employees in one or more tranches. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The options issued under the MSOP generally are subject to both service and performance conditions. The service condition is typically one
year, and the performance conditions are based on the consolidated revenue and adjusted profit before tax of Aeries Technology Group&nbsp;Business Accelerators Pvt&nbsp;Ltd. The stock-based compensation expense is recognized in the <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">carve-out</FONT> consolidated statements of comprehensive income using the straight-line attribution method over the requisite service period if it is probable that the performance target will be achieved. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-98 </P>

</DIV></Center>


<p style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"> </p>
