<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><B>17.</B></TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left"><B>Leases </B></P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company has operating and finance leases for real estate, computer equipment, and furniture and fixtures. Assets acquired under finance
leases are recorded in &#147;Property and equipment, net&#148; in the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">carve-out</FONT> consolidated balance sheets and were $542 and $811 as of March&nbsp;31, 2023 and March&nbsp;31, 2022, respectively. Accumulated
depreciation associated with finance lease assets was $971 and $585 as of March&nbsp;31, 2023 and March&nbsp;31, 2022, respectively. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-99 </P>

