<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>Company Holders</U>&#148; means the shareholders of the Company as of the date of this Agreement. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>Company Incentive Plans</U>&#148; means collectively, (a)&nbsp;the 2020 Employee Stock Option Plan adopted by the Company on
