or in connection with the PIPE Investment. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>Environmental Laws</U>&#148; means any and all applicable Laws relating to Hazardous
