with respect to such Group Company&#146;s execution or delivery of this Agreement or any other Transaction Document to which it is a party or the consummation by such Group Company of the
Transactions, except for (a)&nbsp;the filings listed on <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;4.5</U> of the AARK Schedules, (b)&nbsp;any consents, approvals, authorizations, designations, declarations, waivers or filings, the absence of which would not,
