acquire any of its Equity Securities. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><A NAME="anxa479906_15"></A>Section&nbsp;4.7 <U>Statutory Registers</U>. Except as set forth on
<U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;4.7</U> of the AARK Schedules or in de minimis respects, all registers, statutory books, books of account and other corporate records of the Group Companies are </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">A-22 </P>

</DIV></Center>


