<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<U>Employee Merger Consideration Shares</U>&#148; means 52,600 Parent Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares to be issued to employees of the
Company pursuant to <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;2.5</U>. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The foregoing amendments shall be deemed effective as of October&nbsp;9, 2023.
