(&#147;<U>Joinder Agreement</U>&#148;) is a joinder to the Exchange Agreement, dated as of [&#9679;], 2023 (as amended from time to time, the &#147;<U>Exchange Agreement</U>&#148;), among Aeries Technology, Inc., a Cayman Islands exempted company
