Section&nbsp;3401(c) and the Treasury Regulations thereunder) of the Company or any Parent or Subsidiary of the Company. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
