India&#148; in accordance with the (Indian) Foreign Exchange Management Act, 1999 and regulations issued thereunder. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
