the Initial Share Pool stated in Section&nbsp;3(a), plus, to the extent allowable under Code Section&nbsp;422 and the Treasury Regulations promulgated thereunder, any Shares that become available
for issuance under this Plan pursuant to this Section&nbsp;3(b). </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
